## apps/web — environment example
## Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) when running locally.

# API base URL used by the Next.js rewrite proxy (server-side).
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_PROXY_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001

# Public app name (used in <title> + branding).
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Heuresys

# Default locale (it | en).
NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LOCALE=it
